= The PDE Zoo

/ Laplace, Poisson: equilibrium, elliptic, potentials.
/ Diffusion: heat, first time derivative.
/ Wave: second time derivative.
/ Helmholtz: steady-state wave, eigenvalue problem.
/ Lamé: elastostatics.
/ Stokes: creeping incompressible flow.
/ Navier-Stokes: fluid dynamics.
